CC BY 4.0 for MBARI Pacific Sound recordings and models

This file records the third-party license for MBARI Pacific Sound materials used by this project. It does not relicense original files in this repository. Those remain under the MIT License in LICENSE.

The AWS Open Data Registry dataset "Pacific Ocean Sound Recordings" sets License: CC-BY 4.0 and lists both the sound-recording buckets and s3://pacific-sound-models ("machine learning models").

- https://registry.opendata.aws/pacific-sound/
- https://github.com/awslabs/open-data-registry/blob/main/datasets/pacific-sound.yaml

Copyright holder of those recordings and models: Monterey Bay Aquarium Research Institute (MBARI).

This repository does not contain the audio or the model weights. If either is shared, attribute MBARI, link the registry entry and the model page, and note any changes.

The Blue A tutorial notebook is marked GPL. That statement covers the notebook code, not this CC BY 4.0 record.
https://docs.mbari.org/pacific-sound/notebooks/bluewhales/classify/blueA/PacificSoundClassifyBlueA/

